\ Regression: under interpreter-free AOT, a quotation body that calls a word
\ brought in with `use` compiles instead of being rejected. quot_doubler writes
\ [ 5 double ] after `use`-importing double; freeze pushes every loaded module's
\ deps frame during discovery, so `double` resolves against quot_doubler and the
\ body bakes a direct call. The printed 10 confirms the resolved word executed.

use "./support/quot_doubler.1z" ;

run-doubler .
